WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.690
In these truly trying times,

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:05.230
many people may be struggling
with depression, anxiety,

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.540
and other mental health issues.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.140
Unfortunately, there
is one very widespread

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:13.640
mental health issue that
isn't often discussed.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:16.363
Luckily, there's a new medication to help.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.870
[Announcer] Are you
experiencing extended periods

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:21.000
of happiness?

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.230
Feeling little to no anxiety?

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:25.320
Still looking on the bright side?

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:27.593
Something must be
seriously wrong with you.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.370
Given everything that's been going on,

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:33.180
you should be freaking out.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:36.270
Luckily, Realitrex is here to help.

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:39.040
Once daily Realitrex is a pro-depressant

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.940
and anxiety-inducing medication

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.990
that gives you a healthy dose of reality

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:44.330
to get your head out of your ass

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:46.010
about everything that's going on.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:48.560
Before Realitrex, I used
to walk all around town

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:49.710
with no mask on.

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:52.963
Now, I realize we're in a
pandemic and death is everywhere.

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:57.860
Didn't really get the Black
Lives Matter protests,

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.400
but after I took a Realitrex,

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:03.660
I thought is America super racist?

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:06.650
Turns out it is. (chuckles)

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.500
Thanks for Realitrex.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.670
[Announcer] Side effects include

00:01:09.670 --> 00:01:11.430
understanding what's really happening,

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:13.440
increased sensitivity
to what's been going on

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.430
for a long time,

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:15.513
and diarrhea.

00:01:16.390 --> 00:01:20.830
Realitrex, the safe scientific
way to remind yourself

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:22.850
how awful things really are.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.623
Now available in blueberry.

